:: MP Extra Deep Foghorn 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>冷雨敲打着海蚀暗穴尽头的引航铜标，<<else>>退潮后的海蚀暗穴尽头露出引航铜标，<</if>>副暗渠后方的石壁上嵌着一只双轮潮汐钟与一盏密封鲸油信标灯。<<if (($mpQuestShipwreck or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_foghorn_deep_beacon'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 3 or ($mpQuestCliffLighthouse or 0) gte 2>>你对照旧沉船与雾角塔的潮汐表，看准了双轮潮汐钟的合拍时刻。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_foghorn_deep_beacon"]>><span class="teal">凭着刚校准过的暗穴浮球水位，你一眼看清了双轮潮汐钟的基准齿。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回回音廊 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDeep5_foghorn is 1>>
暗穴尽头的双轮潮汐钟今日已核验完毕，鲸油信标灯泛着幽光。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Foghorn 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-extra-deep-foghorn-5">
<<investigateicon>><<link "拨动潮汐钟指针 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-foghorn-5">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep5_foghorn to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_foghorn_5_rew")>><<money 440>>潮汐钟底匣弹开，露出一卷旧港引航长老封存的航道赏银。<<else>>双轮潮汐钟走时精准，与外海浪声严丝合缝。<</if>><span class="green">你解开了雾角暗穴最深处的潮汐钟机关。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	海雾凝水让铜指针滑了半格，发条发出一声轻响。<span class="red">你甩干指尖水珠退开半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Foghorn 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回回音廊 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "点亮信标灯 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-foghorn-5">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep5_foghorn to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_deep5_foghorn"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_deep5_foghorn"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<skulduggery 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_foghorn_5_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>信标灯暖光穿透石缝照亮暗格，你取出了里面的远洋护航信物铜牌。<<else>>鲸油信标灯火澄澈稳定，照亮了整条暗礁退路。<</if>><span class="green">你重启了尘封多年的暗穴引航信标。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回雾角岛 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Foghorn 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	灯芯受潮微湿，打火轮擦出火星却没能一次引燃。<span class="red">你拨松灯芯准备再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Foghorn 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回到回音廊 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Extra Deep Clockwork 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>子夜的机括城密库深层暗室里，<<else>>机括城档案馆密库深层的恒温暗室里，<</if>>三爪离合簧后方的铸铁基座上立着一具黄铜星历差分筒与一排补偿铅锤。<<if (($mpQuestClocktower or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_clockwork_deep_governor'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 2 or ($mpQuestElkWorkshop or 0) gte 2>>你想起钟塔与工坊的联动齿比，算准了差分筒的归零圈数。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_clockwork_deep_governor"]>><span class="teal">借着先前校准三爪离合簧的余韵，黄铜星历差分筒的棘轮已处于半解状态。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回档案馆密库 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDeep5_clockwork is 1>>
深层暗室的黄铜星历差分筒今日已归零校验，运转声轻快匀净。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Clockwork 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-extra-deep-clockwork-5">
<<investigateicon>><<link "旋转星历差分筒 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-clockwork-5">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep5_clockwork to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_clockwork_5_rew")>><<money 440>>差分筒归零瞬间，底座滑出一盒早年总技师留下的精密工坊银币。<<else>>星历刻度对齐分明，齿轮组发出悦耳的嗡鸣。<</if>><span class="green">你彻底复原了密库底层的星历差分机括。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	差分筒内圈的止逆簧略紧，旋动时震麻了你的指尖。<span class="red">你松开手腕活动了一下手指。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Clockwork 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回档案馆密库 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "挂上补偿铅锤 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-clockwork-5">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep5_clockwork to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_deep5_clockwork"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_deep5_clockwork"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<skulduggery 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_clockwork_5_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>铅锤坠落带动暗门滑开，你将里面封存的工程纪念母模收入囊中。<<else>>补偿铅锤稳稳悬垂，主副发条的张力平衡如初。<</if>><span class="green">你用配重法完美稳住了深层机芯。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回机括城 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Clockwork 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	补偿铅锤分量颇沉，挂钩在铜环边擦出一声轻响。<span class="red">你双手托稳铅锤定下神。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Clockwork 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回到档案馆密库 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Extra Deep Abbey 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>地面雨声透过沉没修道院的石拱隐隐传来，<<else>>幽寂的沉没修道院地下圣骨龛内室里，<</if>>古排水槽尽头的祭台下摆着一只银掐丝圣物匣与一盏长明石脂灯。<<if (($mpQuestCatacomb or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_abbey_deep_relig'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 3 or ($mpQuestMoonAltar or 0) gte 2>>你认出匣面与神殿墓穴一脉相承的七星封记，摸清了开启次序。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_abbey_deep_relig"]>><span class="teal">对照先前在圣骨龛石槽辨认出的古教团铭文，你看懂了银掐丝圣物匣的扣环。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回灰烬藏经阁 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Scriptorium]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDeep5_abbey is 1>>
内室祭台下的银掐丝圣物匣今日已妥善封存，石脂灯火澄明。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Abbey 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-extra-deep-abbey-5">
<<investigateicon>><<link "拨开圣物匣 (0:07)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-abbey-5">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep5_abbey to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_abbey_5_rew")>><<money 440>>圣物匣轻响开启，里面码放着早年修道院长封存的救济银币。<<else>>匣内丝绒衬垫干爽如新，古教团手札完好无损。<</if>><span class="green">你解开了修道院内室圣物匣的七星锁。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Abbey Scriptorium]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	银掐丝扣环上的陈年蜂蜡颇硬，拨动时刮红了指腹。<span class="red">你吹了吹指尖退后半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Abbey 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回灰烬藏经阁 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Scriptorium]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "锁簧与石面的回声">>
<br>
<<link "挑亮长明灯 (0:08)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-abbey-5">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 440 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep5_abbey to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_deep5_abbey"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_deep5_abbey"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<history 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_abbey_5_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>澄澈灯火照亮祭台底缝，你取出了藏在石座下的古修会奉纳牌。<<else>>温暖灯火驱散了地底寒意，石室显得庄严宁静。<</if>><span class="green">长明灯火让你看清了祭台底座的全部暗记。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回修道院 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Abbey 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	石脂油略显浓稠，倾倒时灯焰晃动了一下。<span class="red">你稳住铜油壶缓了口气。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Abbey 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回到灰烬藏经阁 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Scriptorium]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "锁簧与石面的回声">>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Extra Deep Glasshouse 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜色笼罩下的秘密温室地下酿造室深处，<<else>>温润静谧的秘密温室地下酿造室最里间，<</if>>恒温石槽内并排陈列着三只水晶封存瓮与一架黄铜比重计。<<if (($mpQuestGreenhouse or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_glasshouse_deep_essence'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 3 or ($mpQuestGardenWell or 0) gte 2>>你凭着先前查访花房与古井的见识，一眼认出了头等秘露的封蜡色泽。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_glasshouse_deep_essence"]>><span class="teal">循着方才蒸馏瓶里那缕独特的冷兰幽香，你准确挑出了中间那只水晶封存瓮。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回夜光标本廊 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Specimen]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDeep5_glasshouse is 1>>
地下酿造室的水晶封存瓮今日已核验完毕，冷兰幽香萦绕不散。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Glasshouse 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-extra-deep-glasshouse-5">
<<investigateicon>><<link "测水晶瓮 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-glasshouse-5">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep5_glasshouse to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_glasshouse_5_rew")>><<money 440>>瓮底暗格随浮标升起而弹开，露出一叠名流预付的珍稀香精定金。<<else>>比重刻度分毫不差，水晶瓮内的冷兰秘露澄澈莹润。<</if>><span class="green">你掌握了秘密温室核心秘露的配比。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Glasshouse Specimen]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	水晶瓮口凝着一层滑腻香脂，比重计玻璃管差点滑脱。<span class="red">你连忙用软布托住玻璃管。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Glasshouse 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回夜光标本廊 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Specimen]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "提取样本小瓶 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-glasshouse-5">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep5_glasshouse to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_deep5_glasshouse"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_deep5_glasshouse"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<history 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_glasshouse_5_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span>锡封完好揭下，你在瓮座夹层里起出了庄园主私藏的沙龙贵宾花牌。<<else>>样本小瓶封存妥帖，锡封复原后看不出丝毫痕迹。<</if>><span class="green">你悄无声息地取出了秘露核心样本。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回秘密温室 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Glasshouse 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	锡封边缘比预想锋利，刮动时在指肚上留下一道白印。<span class="red">你按住指腹退开半步。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Glasshouse 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回到夜光标本廊 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Specimen]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Extra Deep Blackiron 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>冷雨敲打着黑铁货运站给水塔下的铁门，<<else>>黑铁货运站给水塔下方的隐秘调度室里，<</if>>铸铁台面上摊着一本专线联运密册，旁边立着一具双柄电报发报机。<<if (($mpQuestSmuggler or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_blackiron_deep_waybill'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 3 or ($mpQuestFoundry or 0) gte 2>>你对照港区走私与私铸工坊的货运代号，看懂了密册上的发车时刻。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_blackiron_deep_waybill"]>><span class="teal">对照方才从水塔底座翻出的押运底单，你立刻对上了联运密册的校验页码。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回走私月台 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDeep5_blackiron is 1>>
水塔调度室的专线联运密册今日已核对完毕，发报机安静待命。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Blackiron 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-extra-deep-blackiron-5">
<<investigateicon>><<link "取出专线货单 (0:07)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-blackiron-5">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep5_blackiron to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_blackiron_5_rew")>><<money 440>>密册夹层里滑出一封未拆封的押运主管备用银票。<<else>>联运密册上的班次与吨位核对得一清二楚。<</if>><span class="green">你摸清了黑铁货运站整条夜间专线的脉络。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	调度室灯光昏黄，密册上的缩写代码一时看得眼花。<span class="red">你揉了揉眉心合上册页。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Blackiron 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回走私月台 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "铁件与道砟的响动">>
<br>
<<link "确认空车轨位 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-blackiron-5">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep5_blackiron to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_deep5_blackiron"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_deep5_blackiron"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<skulduggery 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_blackiron_5_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>电报回执跳出纸带，机座下的暗盒随之弹开，露出一卷加急专线调度铜签。<<else>>电报簧片清脆作响，备用股道的绿灯在远处稳稳亮起。<</if>><span class="green">你用发报机彻底掌握了货场的轨道调度权。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Blackiron 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	发报机按键弹簧有些生涩，连击时漏了一拍滴答声。<span class="red">你松开电键平复呼吸。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Blackiron 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回到走私月台 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
