:: MP Extra Deep Druid 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>星辉洒在深林古石环北侧的月泉副眼上，<<else>>林雾萦绕的深林古石环北侧月泉副眼旁，<</if>>盘结的古橡树根下嵌着一座青铜日晷盘与一只盛满清露的玉石臼。<<if (($mpQuestManorRuins or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_druid_deep_seed'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 2 or ($mpQuestMoonAltar or 0) gte 2>>你凭着森林遗迹与月神祭坛的历法知识，认出了日晷盘上的冬夏至槽位。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_druid_deep_seed"]>><span class="teal">借着方才在副眼旁唤醒的古林草木生机，青铜日晷盘上的苔痕已清晰可辨。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回古根地穴 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Rootcave]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDeep5_druid is 1>>
月泉副眼旁的青铜日晷盘今日已校准完毕，清露在石臼中澄澈如镜。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Druid 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-extra-deep-druid-5">
<<investigateicon>><<link "转动青铜日晷盘 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-druid-5">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep5_druid to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_druid_5_rew")>><<money 440>>日晷底座缓缓旋开，露出一袋早年守林长老封存的古银币。<<else>>青铜晷针与石环主柱连成一线，林间风声格外清越。<</if>><span class="green">你解开了古石环月泉副眼的星历机关。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Rootcave]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	日晷盘槽里卡着几粒坚硬松塔，转动时刮痛了指尖。<span class="red">你清开松塔甩了甩手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Druid 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回古根地穴 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Rootcave]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "润泽古根 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-druid-5">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 440>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep5_druid to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_deep5_druid"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_deep5_druid"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<history 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_druid_5_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span>古橡树根须舒展开来，托出一只装着林间古林奉纳木牌的柏木小匣。<<else>>清露渗入树根，四周的夜光白藓齐齐泛起柔和银辉。<</if>><span class="green">古石环的草木灵气令你心神无比宁静。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回深林石环 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Druid 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	山林夜露冰凉刺骨，捧水时冻得你指节微微发僵。<span class="red">你搓热掌心缓了口气。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Druid 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回到古根地穴 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Rootcave]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Quest Velvet Mirage 9 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>子夜的海蚀崖底私密交接室烛火摇曳，<<else>>天鹅绒暗层最底部的海蚀崖交接密室里，<</if>>乌木长案上摆着一只镶银密码押箱与一架双盘天平，天平旁的绒垫上搁着那枚纯银狐面火漆章。<<if (($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_velvet_epilogue_seal'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 7 or ($mpQuestVelvet or 0) gte 3>>你对照先前掌握的暗层名流代号，一眼看出了密码押箱的三位转轮数字。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_velvet_epilogue_seal"]>><span class="teal">凭着方才在拍卖暗厅破译的荧光密码与这枚狐面火漆章，密码押箱的副锁已经解开。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回拍卖暗厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpVelvetMirage9 is 1>>
海蚀崖底交接密室的镶银密码押箱今日已核验妥当，暗门严密合拢。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-quest-velvet-mirage-9">
<<investigateicon>><<link "打开押箱 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-velvet-mirage-9">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpVelvetMirage9 to 1>><<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to Math.max(($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0), 9)>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("velvet_mirage_9_rew")>><<money 460>>押箱应声弹开，你将里面封存的压轴拍卖保证金券收入怀中。<<else>>押箱内衬的丝绒账册整洁如初，所有暗码均已记录在册。<</if>><span class="green">你彻底掌控了天鹅绒暗层最机密的交接底箱。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	转轮弹簧紧绷，拨动第三位数字时滑过了半格。<span class="red">你凝神听准簧音退开半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回拍卖暗厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "放上狐面银章 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-velvet-mirage-9">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpVelvetMirage9 to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_velvet_mirage_9"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_velvet_mirage_9"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to Math.max(($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0), 9)>><<skulduggery 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("velvet_mirage_9_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>天平两端精准持平，乌木长案下弹出执事长预留的特等沙龙印信。<<else>>双盘天平稳稳平衡，烛火映照着狐面银章的冷冽光泽。<</if>><span class="green">你以暗层最高信物赢得了整条密道的通行权。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回天鹅绒暗层 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	海蚀崖底穿堂风吹晃了天平托盘，指针微微偏斜。<span class="red">你伸手挡住风口稳住托盘。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回到拍卖暗厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Quest Observatory Wing 9 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>星空璀璨的旧天文翼楼钟楼顶层暗阁里，<<else>>天光澄澈的旧天文翼楼钟楼顶层暗阁里，<</if>>隐藏星轨仪的中央托架上嵌着一枚水晶天球仪与一卷铜版星表。<<if (($mpQuestObservatoryWing or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_observatory_epilogue_star'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 7 or ($mpQuestArchives or 0) gte 3 or ($mpQuestSchoolBell or 0) gte 3>>你结合学园档案与大钟星图的坐标，看懂了水晶天球仪的黄道交点。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_observatory_epilogue_star"]>><span class="teal">顺着方才星轨仪指向的北极辅星刻度，水晶天球仪的赤纬卡环已然松开。</span><</if>>
